      "text": "⸻\n\n🔴 INTERNATIONAL MUTUAL AID LIST\nPlease share if you can.\n\n🚨🚨🚨\n\n🇨🇺 Cuba – Medical masks for healthcare workers (~40,000 needed)\nOrganizer: @GoodVibePolitik (James) – see profile / Venmo (James-Ray-24)\n\n⸻\n\n🇺🇸 UNITED STATES\n\n@hooraydhd (lunabluhma) – $3,542.91 – Urgent bills (power shut-off notice)\n@PenGwenWithLC – ~$100 – Power\n@MyMutualMermaid (Angel) – $55 – Overdue bill (chronically ill, urgent)\n@lovealltrans (TLove) – $50 – Medicines (urgent)\n@KyPeterson91 (Ky Peterson) – $1,200 – Displaced after house fire, needs hotel stay\n@princesshoped – $200 electric + $500 medical / eyeglasses\n\n🚨 URGENT\nAreanna (@ThatsAllAreanna) – Food for 4 kids + shelter due daily\n\n@SpoonieStella – $200 insurance – Disabled family of 3 (recently homeless) 🌞\n\n@froglet80 – ~$100 – Stove replacement + meds + soft food (trigeminal neuralgia flare)\nSupport: https://t.co/uV3gNBjwxO | https://t.co/m4q0QzGvpL\n\n@NatalyNicole_ – Survival funds\n@The_Great_Null – See profile\n@brownskingirlsm (KiKi) – Facing eviction, respiratory illness 🌞\n@amkd051 – $38 – Shelter for mother and daughter (freezing weather)\n\n⸻\n\n🇬🇧 UNITED KINGDOM\n\n@christianm1988 (crispy) – £100 – Emergency food (diabetic risk)\n\n⸻\n\n🇵🇸 PALESTINE / GAZA\n\n@Yara_and_cats – See profile 💙💙💙\n@Rehamhelu – Chuffed campaign – Eid support / clothing for children\n@MirasFamilyGaza (Mira’s Family) – $850 – Rent urgently due (GoFundMe in profile)\n@mhmmdalna (Doaa Mohammed) – Survival fund (<$500 raised) – shelter, food, medical (Chuffed campaign)\n@DalalIsmail46704 (Dalal Ismail) – Family food support (Chuffed campaign)\n@mhmmd_tarig (Muhammad Tariq) – Mutual aid request (see profile / supporter network)\n@AlmsrySlah44820 (Salah) – $200 urgent basic needs\n@Layat1999 (Mohanad) – Child burn treatment + family support (see profile campaign)\n@OdayMohamm65286 (Oday Mohammed) – Family support campaign (see https://t.co/CDY4c3qQl8 project)\n@toot3577088 (Karim) – Family of 15 – Food + cancer medication\n@gaza_bilal – $350 burn medication\n@israaJamal91 (Israa) – Family rebuilding campaign\n@abw27916 (Shadi) – Family support\n@SanaAzzam2000 (Sanaa) – $50 – Heart medication for father (urgent)\n@Radwan05491 – Food support\n@Hady_moin – Ongoing campaign\n@alathamnaa – Free health tent\n\n🌞 @YSaidibrah32254 (Yousef) – Baby milk, diapers & medicine\n🌞 @IGaza72496 (Ismail) – $200 medication for critically ill sister\n\n⸻\n\n🌍 OTHER\n\n@molamcham – Food support for family (see bio link)\n@queerAmira – Nabirye grandmother medical support campaign (Uganda) 🇺🇬\n\n🇵🇭 PHILIPPINES –\n@jujupaupau – $2,000 chemo bill for mom + $100 for food 🚨🚨🚨\n\n⸻\n\n🌎 ADDITIONAL MUTUAL AID\n\n@Jnlyyyn89456 (JHO) – ~$700 – Rent, phone/internet, groceries for single mom and kids\n@hyperverbal_lee – See pinned – urgent needs (boost requested)\n@randwriter – See profile – mutual aid request\n\n⸻\n\n🤝 ROHINGYA COMMUNITY\n\n@RohingyaRCP – Rohingya Community Partners\nRamadan meal support and literacy programs — see profile for latest iftar campaigns 🌞\n\n⸻\n\n🇨🇦🇵🇸\nWe are all part of the same humanity. Borders, affluence, ability, language, religion, race and ethnicity are all superficial lines around which we construct meaning and bias.\n\nBuy a family groceries, then support the efforts of https://t.co/2wi23lyhkF Legal Centre for Palestine to fight for justice under the law.\n\n⸻",
